<title>USA: DuPont starts IT alliance with CSC, Andersen.</title>
<headline>DuPont starts IT alliance with CSC, Andersen.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>DuPont Co said Monday that it has started up its global information technology alliance with Computer Sciences Corp and Andersen Consulting.</p>
<p>The technology outsourcing alliance, first announced in December 1996, is valued at more than $4.0 billion over 10 years, the company said.</p>
<p>DuPont said it has moved about 2,600 information systems employees to Computer Sciences which will operate DuPont's global information systems and technology infrastructure.</p>
</text>
